  "content": "<h3>Свежепереработанные и более мощно выглядящие трidents!</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://i.gyazo.com/caeabf91f2a4ffd2f49800fab5b9b44c.pngv&n=-1\" alt=\"Image\"></p>\n<p><strong>Для работы этой упаковки необходимы следующие моды</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentitytexturefeatures\" rel=\"nofollow\">ETF</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentity-model-features%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMF</a></span></p>\n<p>Содержание этой мини-пакета происходит из更大的项目，我正在开发，称为<span style=\"color:#00e4ff\"><strong><a style=\"color:#00e4ff\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252frappenems-reforge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Rappenem's Reforge</a>&nbsp;</strong></span>，旨在以这种风格重新绘制整个游戏。因此，如果你喜欢这里展示的像素艺术，可以考虑查看它并在<span style=\"color:#ff49fa\"><strong>&nbsp;<a style=\"color:#ff49fa\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/Rappenem\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a></strong></span>上支持我，以获得早期访问和额外内容！</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Rappenem\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/fe2313e6ca2c3df47d179aa09bbc4c57799f6094.png\" alt=\"FF\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252f2hvKFfPzQt\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/95be1badf0f5131587308606c53801d55223882c.png\" alt=\"D\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.instagram.com%252frappenems_reforge%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/77276c296d994e962ff04b57a57206c7abf516de.png\" alt=\"F\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fRapps_Reforge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/24c2ce58d5be6a91a8fb4e14aee09b885f105ad5.png\" alt=\"H\"></a></p>",
